    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Abubaker Mohammed, a nursing faculty member from Uganda, takes leave to pursue a Master's of Science in Nursing with a focus in teaching at the University of Alberta, Canada. He has decided that now is the right time to make this move, to ensure he continues to meet teaching qualifications required by the regulatory body in Uganda.",
